OL,3,GNEWSAParents turn to costume swap to
OL,4,Acut Halloween costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents in Merseyside are turning to a
OL,7,Ffree Halloween costume swap scheme to
OL,8,Favoid prices one mother described as
OL,9,F"completely extortionate".
OL,11,FLola Roberts, who visited Prescot
OL,12,FLibrary with her children, said her son
OL,13,Fhad chosen a clown costume costing #40,
OL,14,Fso she showed him free alternatives.
OL,16,FKnowsley Council is running the scheme
OL,17,Fduring half-term to help families save
OL,18,Fmoney and reduce the number of costumes
OL,19,Fthrown away after Halloween.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
